  <article class="prose">
    <h2>How to use this</h2>
    <p>Cuties is the short version. This is what you're walking into.</p>
    <h2>Me</h2>
    <p>I'm Taylor. I've been playing professional poker for about twenty years. I'm somewhere between still being a pro and being retired. I still play and I still make money. I just don't need to. I host a game because I like it. It rains money on the people around the table. I don't take a cut of the girls. I don't rake my friends. Overnight every week was ruining my life. I sleep now.</p>
    <p>I have two kids. Fridays I have them. I'm trying to teach them to deal, DoorDash, a training night, because I think live games are a human thing that lasts. They're outliers. Curious monsters. I want another adult in the room who can keep up, even if that's just Set. They've told me they like when there's a woman around and that I'm more fun with company.</p>
    <p>I was married. That ended. We'd been poly before we separated. In 2021 I had a thing I still don't have a clean name for, and I started trying to tell the truth on purpose. I run charismatic software on slightly autistic hardware. If you're an empath and you only speak on the emotional channel, I will miss it, especially when I'm tired. Use words.</p>
    <p>I hike. Martin Canyon Creek, near Danville. Pickleball all the time, used to be collegiate tennis, shoulders are shot. Pinball two or three times a week. Cold plunge, hot tub, backyard with a hill. I let the car drive. Costco/Target is the right amount of stuff. I left social media in 2020. I'm not coming back to that tribe.</p>
    <h2>What I want</h2>
    <p>I want to rip a girl out of her own life and stick her in mine. A real one. Not a visitor. Not staff. I also know that's a red flag. I don't want a woman with no life. I want one who has one and still chooses mine. I haven't resolved that. I'm saying it anyway.</p>
    <p>I keep mixing the game with whoever I'm in love with. I'm stopping. If you wanna be my girl, you leave the circus behind. I still host. You'll feel that weather. You don't clock into it.</p>
    <p>I lean poly and I fall into de facto monogamy because I entwine. I would like a possibly-primary partner. Someone who would attend RMN or Slutcon is a filter for this chapter, not a job requirement.</p>
    <p>I am good at making money and somewhat lackluster at taking care of myself. I want a partner who takes care of me and the house, and who can actually receive the amount of affection I put out, which often turns into sex. I provide. Costco floor, not a trap: if you live here, after a year you start accruing a real safety net. Nights I want you in the Room, 10 to 8, unless we're out. Edges are negotiable. The core isn't.</p>
    <h2>Sex</h2>
    <p>I want a good girl. The kind who likes being called that, or whore, and means it. I've never had a partner who liked those words who wasn't a sexual match. Horny gremlin. High drive.</p>
    <p>If three or four times a week is your ceiling we fail. Twice a day is closer to the truth. I want to wake you up at sunrise and fuck you back to sleep. That's my best REM and I miss it. If your eyes light up at that, say so.</p>
    <p>Default is free-use in a relationship: you don't say no because you don't want to, because we're actually having a good time. Attention should never feel like punishment. Anal is a real need, not a spicy extra. All holes, often, with you wanting that.</p>
    <p>I was trained as a service top by women who needed extras. Spanking, choking, the rest. I can do it. I prefer not to cause you real pain to get what I want. I get there when you're actually a good girl, not when I have to fight you.</p>
    <p>The Room: you walk in on purpose. I stop on Red or a double tap. Then we go to another room. World is no touch without a verbal yes. House is hugs unless I already know you don't want them.</p>
    <p>Jack is a hat. If you call me Jack, that character is allowed to use pain until you're receptive. Red still works. I don't know yet if the name is enough. It's opt-in.</p>
    <p>I went to RMN in early 2026 and I wasn't ready. Token resistance I know. Prey that fight, I didn't. I would like a partner who would go, and who is curious. I am not looking for a stranger-CNC lifestyle as the relationship.</p>
    <h2>If our beliefs fight</h2>
    <p>I don't think we have the technology to change sex yet. If you register as male to me and tell me you're a woman, I register that you believe interesting things about yourself. I don't change pronouns I don't believe. I disengage. If that's a problem, this won't work.</p>
    <h2>Practical</h2>
    <p>East Bay / Danville. Avoiding the apps. Pickleball, dance, real life. I'm going to Slutcon in September. If you want to meet there, say so. It might be the one place I can lead with the morning-sex question. I like this crowd. I don't need to hunt the hostess. I need someone who actually wants the life.</p>
